{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261DncMJUYMV1795486898.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價連升兩天，並見逾四年高位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7111，較上個交易日上調9點子，是自2022年7月11日以來的高位。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段都於6.66水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展5,160億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放165億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.674871+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:57:14.739724+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:37:19.517991+00:00","content_hash":"31428360edabad53fa0bf002d8f084ab530d515f8d6267bdab475efc7e754656","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.674871+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}